---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Traveller: The New Era"
description: "A static archive of the Traveller_TNE Yahoo! Group — Traveller: The New Era fans, 2005–2019 — preserved as threaded, searchable posts."
---
<h1>Search or browse the archive</h1>
<p class="lede">724 emails' worth of ship designs, house rules, worldbuilding, and years of debate about jump drives and jump fuel — preserved as threaded, searchable posts after Yahoo Groups shut the original community down in 2020.</p>

<form class="search-form" role="search" method="get" action="{{ '/search/' | url }}" aria-label="Search the archive">
  <label class="visually-hidden" for="home-search">Search the archive</label>
  <input id="home-search" name="q" type="search" placeholder="Search the archive…">
  <button class="btn" type="submit">Search</button>
</form>

<h2>Recent posts</h2>
<ul class="post-list">
  {% for post in posts.recentPosts %}
  <li>
    <a class="post-title" href="{{ ('/posts/' + post.id + '/') | url }}">{{ post.subject }}</a>
    <span class="post-meta">{{ post.author.display_name }} · {{ post.date_utc | formatDate }}</span>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
